@supabase/config/effect is the Effect-native superset of the root entrypoint and exports Effect-returning config loading and saving, config paths, the CliConfigStore service and layer, project-environment resolution, and functions-manifest inference.
@supabase/config/effect re-exports everything from the @supabase/config root entrypoint.
Monorepo consumers import Effect-native symbols from ./effect, pure symbols from ., and never import package-internal files directly.
